    10	
    11	## Risks
    12	The local dual certificate only lower-bounds regret when the common-prefix action law is genuinely shared and outside rewards are capped; otherwise this repeats the failed local-κ-as-standalone mistake.
    13	
    14	## Suggested Lenses
    15	- proof strategy
    16	- lower-bound transfer
    17	- quantifier check

